  "content": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d;\">注意：我已經在處理寶箱戰利品，以及即將為遊戲帶來5個新寶箱的更新。</span></p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">Cobblemon：簡易寶可夢中心</h1>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>◽ 功能版本（需搭配Cobblemon）：1.20.1 / 1.21.1<br>◽ 裝飾版本：1.21.2 / 1.21.3 / 1.21.4</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>◽ 你是否曾在冒險途中，找不到地方治療你的寶可夢？</strong><br><strong>◽ 這個簡單的模組添加了一個寶可夢中心，內含一些樹果、治療機和電腦。</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>◽ 若要設定建築物之間的生成距離，你必須開啟模組的「Jar」檔案，前往 -&gt;&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #ced4d9;\">data/cobblemon_simple_center/worldgen/structure_set/pokecenter.json</span>。在檔案內，修改「<span style=\"color: #ba372a;\">spacing</span>」和「<span style=\"color: #ba372a;\">separation</span>」數值。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>◽ 若要設定建築物會出現的生態域，你需要開啟模組的「Jar」檔案，前往 -&gt; <span style=\"color: #ced4d9;\">data/cobblemon_simple_center/tags/worldgen/biome/has_structure/pokecenter.json</span>。在檔案內，根據標籤修改生態域，例如<span style=\"color: #ba372a;\">#c:is_forest</span>。</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>我的其他模組：</strong></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d;\"><a style=\"color: #e03e2d;\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/cobblemon-create-industries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Create：Cobblemon工業</a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d;\"><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/cobblemon-additions-tools\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Cobblemon：武器、盔甲與工具</a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d;\"><a style=\"color: #e03e2d;\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/cobblemon-additions-tools\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Cobblemon：寶可夢實驗室</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d;\"><a style=\"color: #e03e2d;\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/cobblemon-botany-pots\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Cobblemon：植物盆栽</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d;\"><a style=\"color: #e03e2d;\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/cobblemore-library\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Cobblemore 函式庫</a></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_f4b8a61e-6475-4bb5-ad4b-c00841ef365f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"500\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_4dce2554-8143-4483-a779-699fb0e86fe8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"500\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h3>模型來源：@<a href=\"https://www.planetminecraft.com/member/styrix/\" rel=\"nofollow\">styrix</a></h3>",
